# ============================================================
# DO NOT IGNORE THESE FARM AI PROJECT FILES
# ============================================================
#
# backend/models/*.pkl
# backend/models/*.keras
# backend/models/*.pth
# backend/models/*.csv
#
# These contain your actual ML models and datasets.
#
# IMPORTANT:
# plant_disease_model_final.keras is >50 MB,
# so use Git LFS for it:
#
# git lfs install
# git lfs track "backend/models/*.keras"
#
# ============================================================